            16
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Ask Jeremiah to Seek God's Will",
      "description": "Johanan and the people asked the prophet Jeremiah to pray to the Lord to find out whether they should stay in the land or go to Egypt. They promised to obey God's answer.",
      "verses": [
        {
          "bookId": 24,
          "chapter": 42,
          "verses": [
