          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "God's Answer Through Jeremiah",
      "description": "After ten days, the word of the Lord came to Jeremiah: The people were to remain in Judah and not fear the king of Babylon, for God would protect them. Going to Egypt would lead to destruction.",
